d 'IVONESAMPLEMR': module module for one-sample Mendelian randomization and instrumental variable analyses
d
d   ivonesamplemr provides commands for one-sample Mendelian
d randomization (MR) and other instrumental variable (IV) analyses,
d particularly with binary outcomes. ivlsmm and ivmsmm fit logistic
d and multiplicative structural mean models, estimating causal odds
d ratios and risk ratios; ivtsps and ivtsri fit two-stage predictor
d substitution and two-stage residual inclusion estimators; ivfsw
d computes Sanderson-Windmeijer conditional F-statistics after
d ivregress or ivreg2; and the prefix commands ivmw and ivxtile
d repeat an IV analysis within moving windows or quantiles of the
d first-stage residuals to explore nonlinear exposure-outcome
d relationships. 
d
d KW:  
d
d Requires: Stata version 13
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261127
d
d Author: Tom Palmer,  University of Bristol
d Support: email tom.palmer@@bristol.ac.uk
d
